# NVIDIA GSP firmware images, pinned by version, image, size and sha256.
#
# One line per image:
#
#	<version> <image> <size> <sha256>
#
# The firmware is never shipped with the package.  The tool fetches the
# file the graphics adapters of the machine need and checks its size and
# its hash against this table before it puts it in place: a file that
# does not match is never placed.
#
# Do not edit a hash here without re-verifying the image against the
# sha256sum that NVIDIA publishes for the release.
#
